        CH("Sakyán (to ride) is an -an verb. Which formula makes its noun?", ["pag- + duplicated first syllable + root", "pag- + root", "paki- + duplicated last syllable of paki- + root"], "pag- + duplicated first syllable + root", "-an verbs work like mag- verbs."),
